    <string name="about_body">DRS Nexus brings eleven essential developer utilities into one native Android app. Every tool runs entirely on-device: JSON parsing uses a real parser, hashing uses the platform security provider, and passwords come from the system secure random source. Your history and favorites live in a local database and nothing is ever uploaded.\n\nBuilt with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose, designed with a native look and feel, and shipped with a complete bilingual interface in Arabic and English including full RTL support.</string>
